# ── DJI Thermal SDK ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Proprietary. Ships under DJI's own EULA and must not be redistributed.
# Download it from DJI and point at it with:
#   $env:DJI_THERMAL_SDK_LIB = "C:\path\to\libdirp.dll"
pure_math_pipeline/vendor/
**/dji_thermal_sdk*/
libdirp.*
*.so
*.dll
*.dylib

# ── Site imagery ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# UNCOMMENT the next two lines if the rooftop captures are client data.
# This repository is public — anything committed here is world-readable,
# and image EXIF from a drone normally carries GPS coordinates.
# KHBPRooftops/
# pure_math_pipeline/results/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
venv/
.venv/
env/

# ── Secrets / environment ────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
*.key

# ── OS / editor noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
__MACOSX/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
